  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      432.55,
      239.97,
      557.87,
      267.9
    ],
    "text": "Bulletin No MSW/26/11/16/01-EN",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0,
      11.039999961853027,
      11.520000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      269.52,
      557.97,
      349.63
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the West-Central Bay of Bengal deep sea areas and the sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to Hambantota via Trincomalee and Pottuvil.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0,
      12.479999542236328,
      12.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      366.41,
      561.85,
      393.34
    ],
    "text": "The low-pressure area located to the East of Sri Lanka, in the Bay of Bengal, has developed into a \u2018Depression.\u2019",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      399.84,
      561.45,
      412.78
    ],
    "text": "As of 5:30 a.m. today, this system was positioned approximately 600 km northeast of Trincomalee. It is highly",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      419.16,
      559.54,
      432.1
    ],
    "text": "likely that the system will continue to move in a north-westwards, staying well off the east coast of Sri Lanka\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      438.48,
      561.73,
      451.42
    ],
    "text": "and intensify into a \u2018Deep Depression\u2019 by tomorrow morning (November 16). By tomorrow night, it is expected",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      457.82,
      561.73,
      470.76
    ],
    "text": "to develop into a \u2018Cyclonic Storm\u2019 over the southern and adjacent west-central Bay of Bengal, and further",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      477.14,
      479.29,
      490.08
    ],
    "text": "intensify into a \u2018Severe Cyclonic Storm\u2019 over the west-central Bay of Bengal by November 17.",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria",
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      515.93,
      561.94,
      529.43
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded",
    "fonts": [
      "Cambria,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.520000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      36.0,
      536.09,
      561.71,
      549.59
    ],
    "text": "by 05N-15N and 80E-90E, and the sea areas off the coast extending from Kankasanthurai to",
